/*
  OperationsSection.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0250 · OperationsSection (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  OperationsSection resolves (table "OperationsSection") lives here with its web
  t(key, default) English value. These entries fold into the app
  Localizable.xcstrings master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/system/components/status/OperationsSection.tsx, where the bare English
  string is the t() key). The second group backs the native chrome (description,
  freshness / loading / empty / error copy, accordion accessibility) so the Swift
  sources hold no English literals.
*/

